  <para unique="1091619">None.</para>
  </subsection>
 <subsection title="Other Exceptions">
  <para unique="1091624" format="xIndent1">Non-EVEX-encoded instruction, see <link unique="1091622" linkend="&lt;c&gt;__sdm_vol2A_ch02.fm#25627: 06_Table: Table 2-21. Type 4 Class Exception Conditions" xrefstyle="Table All - no page-period">Table&#160;2&#8209;21, &#8220;Type 4 Class Exception Conditions.&#8221;</link></para>
  <para unique="1091628" format="xIndent1">EVEX-encoded instruction, see Exceptions Type E4NF.nb in <link unique="1091626" linkend="&lt;c&gt;__sdm_vol2A_ch02.fm#87496: 06_Table: Table 2-50. Type E4NF Class Exception Conditions" xrefstyle="Table All - no page-period">Table&#160;2&#8209;52, &#8220;Type E4NF Class Exception Conditions.&#8221;</link></para>
  <para unique="1091629" format="xIndent1">Additionally:</para>
  <para unique="1091630" format="xIndent1">#UD 	If VEX.vvvv != 1111B, or EVEX.vvvv != 1111B.</para>
  </subsection>
 </instruction>
